    {
      "file": "course-app/content/hsk2/lesson-05.json",
      "sha256": "aa7a6e96568e2fbfd4c4894778eccbcc34dd894f73fe5f0c25a7bcd7f1ad1038",
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05",
      "source": {
        "startPdfPage": 52,
        "endPdfPage": 60,
        "startPrintedPage": 37,
        "endPrintedPage": 45
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text1",
          "audioTrack": "5-1",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text1:line1",
              "zh": "家月，快下来吧，第一次去中国朋友家，别晚了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 53,
                "printedPage": 38,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text1:line2",
              "zh": "还有时间，你上来吧。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 53,
                "printedPage": 38,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text1:line3",
              "zh": "我不上去了，就在下面等你。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 53,
                "printedPage": 38,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text1:line4",
              "zh": "那我一会儿就下去。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 53,
                "printedPage": 38,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text1:line5",
              "zh": "你快点儿吧。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 53,
                "printedPage": 38,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text1:line6",
              "zh": "没事，一雪姐说11点前到就可以。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 53,
                "printedPage": 38,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text2",
          "audioTrack": "5-3",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text2:line1",
              "zh": "家月、安妮，快进来！我给你们介绍一下，这是孩子们的爷爷、奶奶。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 55,
                "printedPage": 40,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text2:line2",
              "zh": "你们好！",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 55,
                "printedPage": 40,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text2:line3",
              "zh": "爸，妈，这是白家月，这是安妮。她们都是一飞的学生。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 55,
                "printedPage": 40,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text2:line4",
              "zh": "家月、安妮，你们好！",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 55,
                "printedPage": 40,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text2:line5",
              "zh": "这是送你们的礼物。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 55,
                "printedPage": 40,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text2:line6",
              "zh": "你们太客气了，还拿这么多礼物来！",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 55,
                "printedPage": 40,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text2:line7",
              "zh": "一雪姐，这是给孩子们准备的礼物。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 55,
                "printedPage": 40,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text2:line8",
              "zh": "谢谢！你们别客气，快坐吧！",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 55,
                "printedPage": 40,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text3",
          "audioTrack": "5-5",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text3:line1",
              "zh": "都12点了，我们吃饭吧。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 57,
                "printedPage": 42,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text3:line2",
              "zh": "这么多好吃的，您太客气了！",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 57,
                "printedPage": 42,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text3:line3",
              "zh": "都是我自己做的，你们多吃点儿。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 57,
                "printedPage": 42,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text3:line4",
              "zh": "奶茶也很好喝，是您自己做的吗？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 57,
                "printedPage": 42,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text3:line5",
              "zh": "不是，奶茶是爷爷买的。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 57,
                "printedPage": 42,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text3:line6",
              "zh": "在哪儿买的？我还没喝过这么好喝的奶茶。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 57,
                "printedPage": 42,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text3:line7",
              "zh": "就在前边的商场，吃完饭你们可以跟我去看看。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 57,
                "printedPage": 42,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text4",
          "audioTrack": "5-7",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l05:text4:line1",
              "zh": "回国前一天，我们去一雪姐家了。到她家的时候，饭菜都做好了。刘爷爷还准备了奶茶。因为吃了太多东西，我们吃完饭是走回酒店的。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 58,
                "printedPage": 43,
                "section": "课文4",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
